Depends: passwd, fcitx5, fcitx5-data, libxcb1, libxcb-xtest0, libxcb-xinput0, python3-qtpy, python3-dbus, python3-qtpy-pyqt6 | python3-qtpy-pyside6 | python3-qtpy-pyqt5 | python3-pyqt5, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Ngó Sen, a Vietnamese input method for fcitx5
 Ngó Sen is a Vietnamese input method for fcitx5.
 .
 This is Ngó Sen Terminal, an unofficial build of Ngó Sen
 (https://github.com/ngosen/ngosen) that keeps text typed into
 VS Code terminals in order and keeps a new terminal from
 inheriting the previous terminal's keys.
